WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.968
Mount the continuous fryer and oil filter.

00:00:03.038 --> 00:00:07.786
The model accounts separately for oil added and
mass removed as the strips pass through.

00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:14.063
Connect the fryer conveyor encoder to AI07 and
belt speed demand to AO07.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:17.321
The recipe controls residence in the training
model.

00:00:17.531 --> 00:00:20.832
Set model belt residence to 45 seconds.

00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:25.097
Keep the oil circulation permissive visible
during the fault exercise.

00:00:25.307 --> 00:00:27.884
Inject loss of oil circulation proof.

00:00:27.954 --> 00:00:32.359
A healthy belt speed signal does not establish
that the oil is circulating.

00:00:32.569 --> 00:00:35.191
Restore circulation proof before feed.

00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:48.064
The worked mass balance adds 37.866 kilograms
and removes 134.635 kilograms, leaving 744.7
kilograms.
